x since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\n- $I$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, ${i}_{21}=0.1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $G$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ and $G$ are zero matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262599 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087695 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ddb59990-7419-585f-aa1b-901d59c8cfc1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Zero Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048252 :topic/id #uuid "8c876864-a853-56d6-a887-91d7f8f1cf14" :topic/math-academy-id 862 :topic/title "Zero, Square, Diagonal and Identity Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1525f01b-2ae2-5dd4-b801-c694ed68add4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463574} {:answer/id #uuid "13bd1c8a-3615-5ab3-bbc6-12281ca6492f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463575}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "13bd1c8a-3615-5ab3-bbc6-12281ca6492f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463575} :answer-field/id #uuid "a12cf060-14bb-5c32-ae71-e67eabb18f24" :answer-field/key "$R=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464721} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee158078-6dff-5178-8bc6-c42103f550f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463576} {:answer/id #uuid "743db0c8-4fc8-51e5-b59f-4bc00f45f0f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463577}] :answer-field/correct {:answer