37744} :answer-field/id #uuid "ecc05fd9-552e-52c7-aa2c-c25a1903c6fd" :answer-field/key "$B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438901}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "d3df39a1-3dce-5051-9bb1-2a36ee3c62ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-126477" :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $B$ is upper triangular: **True.** This holds because all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular: **False.** This fails because $B$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -5 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $B$ is upper triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262617 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050283 :topic/id #uuid "3cb2a10b-5d06-5efe-b222-3c14b0ccd7c8" :topic/math-academy-id 1777 :topic/title "Triangular Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eb56e3e4-d13e-506f