" :question/worked-solution "Remember that an augmented matrix is in row echelon form if its coefficient matrix satisfies the following conditions:\n\n- All the zero rows (rows with only zeros), if any, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n- Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the first row contains only zeros and it is not at the bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nA=\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 9 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}9 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nC=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $A$ is **not** in row echelon form." :task-item/_content [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526462 :task-item/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262997} :task-item/elapsed-seconds 28.878 :task-item/id #uuid "ef6725aa-277e-44fe-bee0-a9b4a7edc26a" :task-item/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526463} :task-item/responses [{:answer/id #uuid "64657d11-388e-5eea-8953-1183ad80b2a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463755} {:answer/id #uuid "183285c5-ecf3-5b1b-a709-43802b2d5542" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463756} {:answer/id #uuid "1b18bdf6-939a-51c6-93bc-947f0d9b20e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463758}] :task-item/status {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045571}}